Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair's so pretty, Mukuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There! All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? I've sure gotten good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,--And over here is--\N--Asahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're friends from my school.\NWhat a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hello.\N--Nice to meet'cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see our school!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so tiny from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we can see anyone\Nwith the telescope?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't locate Tohka and Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. They're not within east Tengu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't use GPS\Nsince they left their phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the other Spirits\Nhad any luck searching?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Tohka and Origami\Nact odd suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of why,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it's evident that Tohka\Nhas become an Inverse Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as Origami, I think a second\Npersonality has come forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. This world's history was rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside Origami are two personalities:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Origami of the previous world and\Nthe Origami of the world that changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I try to think about it,\Nmy thoughts get all jumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that happening?\NAnd who was it that changed the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it all revolve around Shido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, I've located their Spirit waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispatch a camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:04:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also detecting Spirit waves\Nfrom the two people they're with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Two people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One boy and one girl.\NThough, the boy's waves appear abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously. What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They kicked us out quick,\Nnot that I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight's not over yet.\NTake us to the next battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! There! Tengu Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? The view seems different\Nwhen you're not flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:05:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a legend that couples\Nwho kiss up here live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's fitting\Nfor your next "battle."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but being here\Ngives me a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A bad feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, have you been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's up with Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tohka. What exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an Inverse?\NActually, what are Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I resent being called "Inverse."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's the original\Nform of Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Spirit of Origin made Sephirah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they were what you call "Inverse."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They were "refined" to be\Ncompatible with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold up! The Spirit of Origin?\NTo be compatible with humans?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be mistaken, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't answer to appease you,\Nbut because I felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So weak. Maybe I'll just\Nsteal a kiss by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare try to steal him from Muku?!\NSteal the one Muku loves?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I care, mongrel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you cut Muku's hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister says that he likes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael. Siffleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting this way is more my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Two huge Spirit waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One is Category E: Inverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal... We've gotta seal 'em somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how? How have we\Nsealed Spirits up until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, it's Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami? What's going on?\NWho are those Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later. Can you slow them down\Nusing Fraxinus' territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To a certain extent...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you nuts? Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a way to stop them.\NCan you trust me and help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Territory and Yggdrafolium!\NLet's minimize collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it? Why do I feel like\Nwe've done this countless times?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Fraxinus will hinder\Ntheir movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't face both of them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami, can you help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. If I let you go alone,\NI'd get yelled at by the other me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ID: Origami Tobiichi. Deploy Brunhild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling for me, Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm, Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cretin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Lataib!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Helles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can deconstruct Spirit armor\Nwith that key?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That's your play, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill everyone\Nwho tries to steal him from Muku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting in my way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I hope you're ready to entertain me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka, stop Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill! Kill all who try to steal him!\NMuku hates being alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want Tohka to be gone\Nor the others to forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's a precious friend of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,--How...?\N--Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you love Muku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Muku's love not enough for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate being alone!\NI won't let anyone take you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro... What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka! Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they fighting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek! That's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to steal him\Naway from Muku! Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Segva!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Using Segva on the planet.\NEventually, it will stop spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, none can interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.59,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Muku can\Nstay in space together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I've gotta defeat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,--Guys!\N--Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're that guy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me out! Mukuro--\Nthe Spirit used her key on the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it'll stop spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your power--the power of Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yoshino? Shouldn't we think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't know how to explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel like I should help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? He asked nicely, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. I don't know why,\Nbut I feel like we've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? This sorta thing pumps me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's me. I'm communicating\Nthrough Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,--Kotori!\N--Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like he said, Spirit power\Nhas encroached the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll plunge Yggdrafolium into six areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Use those as focal points\Nto send your Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For a time, we'll be able\Nto stop the spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we trust you to handle this,\NShido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To the girl who needs my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka, please! Let's stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought the fight to me!\NI'm just making the most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll hit her body, not armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you won't survive\NMichael's molecular destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Helles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't, Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, your hopes will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knew who I was at school today!\NNot even my friends or the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?! A freak?! A monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, you're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabriel! Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mu... kuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mister! I... I wasn't\Ntrying to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't leave Muku all alone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Inversion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't! Stop, Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro! Mukuro! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, you're me! I was alone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned the warmth of family when\Nthe Itsuka's took me in, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always afraid that\NI'd be abandoned--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that the people I loved\Nwould move on and abandon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always terrified to think\Nmy happiness might suddenly disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, you're scared, right?\NSo scared that it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen, Mukuro.\NThere's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're connected, no matter how\Nfar away you are. That's what family is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Itsukas--my dad, mom,\Nand Kotori taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I... I don't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you don't have to worry anymore.\NI'll never forget you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI'll never hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not enough.\NYou have to promise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-sided love won't work.\NAfter all, we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. What a sad sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere! Only I can\Nmake Tohka normal again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned that fighter into a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make Tohka sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsuka! Let's get you\Nto Fraxinus' infirmary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine 'cuz I've got Spirit power.\NBut Tohka and Mukuro--!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down, Mister.\NTohka was able to kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,\NMuku won't worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we're family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Some level of intimacy is expected!\N'Cuz we're family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Family is... what to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to look at stars\Nwith my sister like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Muku was a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Muku worry when Sis, Mommy,\Nand Daddy loved me so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's natural. Nobody wants to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No one wants to lose\Nthe place they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister... You're the same as Muku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why Muku\Nfeels at ease around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I should cut my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Muku might wanna change things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure, Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll cut it for Muku, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than family,\Nno one touches Muku's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry or we'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If Origami stopped trying to climb\Ninto Shido's coat, we wouldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:23:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad. I couldn't subdue\Nmy animal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do, Shido? Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, I've returned to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.75,0:23:25.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 08:\N'Key and Sword.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst Spirit has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Her goal? To take Shido's life\Nand Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time:\N"Nightmare's Seduction."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What awaits at the end\Nof this fierce battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 09: 'Nightmare's Seduction.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
